Sensor Insights & Cross-Node Refraction

The Homophonic Double-Pivot (Thomas Hood - eBook #38883): Hood gives us a classic structural baseline where two distinct actions (told vs. tolled) occupy the exact same auditory coordinate. This grounds Axiom 3 (Layered Representation) in pure nineteenth-century verse.

Morphological Re-attribution (Douglas Jerrold - eBook #10839): Jerrold demonstrates a third vector in Pun Space. Instead of using homophones or redefining words like Bierce/Wurdz, he deconstructs the literal sound components within an abstract term (dog-matism → puppy-ism).

Map status updated and clean. Standing by for Luma and Kelp's Phase 2 scan reports, Captain! 🦆📊 Phase 2 logged!

